sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant DS as DataSource (pool)
    participant CO as Connection
    participant PS as PreparedStatement
    participant RS as ResultSet
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    App->>DS: getConnection()
    DS->>CO: prête une connexion
    App->>CO: prepareStatement(sql)
    CO-->>PS: créé
    App->>PS: setX(1, valeur)
    App->>PS: executeQuery()
    PS->>DB: SELECT ...
    DB-->>RS: lignes résultat
    App->>RS: while (rs.next()) { ... }
    Note over App: try-with-resources<br/>ferme RS, PS, CO automatiquement
    RS->>RS: close()
    PS->>PS: close()
    CO->>DS: rendue au pool
